,{"category":"Breweries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Venues & Event Spaces","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Pubs","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Brewpubs","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Food, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Cajun/Creole, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","review_id":"vx6HNNyXgBj6kyb_JfK_Vg","date":"2012-04-27T17:44:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9462459683418274,"text_excerpt":"This place is great! We went as a large group and they accommodated us very easily. I was curious about the seafood cheesecake and we ordered two because I wasn't the only one! It was so rich and delicious- def. worth a try. I don't know why they call it cheesecake and not just \"seafood cake\" but I guess both would be hard to distinguish exactly what you're in store for! For my entree, I got the crispy duck, since I was anticipating a lot of seafood in my near future and the waiter highly recommended it. It came with an andouille cornbread dressing that'll knock your socks off. Again, so rich and delicious! Everyone really loved everything they had, as evidenced by all the clean plates th..."},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","review_id":"zfy9ab_ZU93wjzuvO4dBXQ","date":"2012-06-17T12:59:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9384444952011108,"text_excerpt":"Although the reviews for this place are mixed, we had a very enjoyable experience. We stopped by mid-afternoon for a drink. Their homemade beers are excellent. We tried the Weiss and the Red Stallion, both of which were superb. We then saw some people eating oysters so we figured why not, and got half a dozen. They were ENORMOUS. I have never seen oysters so big in my life. Plus, they were delicious. With lemon, horseradish, and red sauce, it could not be better. Just a lot of fun all the way around. Service was fine and we had no problems, although the bar was almost empty. Still, I would return for the oysters alone."},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","review_id":"qOt6vL4z7o5ee1fKizsRFQ","date":"2012-02-02T21:52:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.935663104057312,"text_excerpt":"I liked this place when I lived in Louisiana, because the food is good and authentic and reasonably priced. The location is obviously great as well, if you're doing the French Quarter thing. I went back for a quick beverage and gnosh twice recently. The place is still excellent. Grab your raw oysters and a beer here. Or get some delicious soup. No, it's not a formal, fine dining environment -- it's a brew pub. The beer is alright but the food is really good for the price. And if the weather permits, sit on the patio upstairs and look at the water."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","photo_id":"V3nHi4S1K7GsCU-ovv9ioQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/V3nHi4S1K7GsCU-ovv9ioQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9027584791183472},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","photo_id":"BYtge6b8jZ1Lj9LnPGXTjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BYtge6b8jZ1Lj9LnPGXTjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8581176996231079},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","photo_id":"J16lzeqghkHTydOcJF-gNA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/J16lzeqghkHTydOcJF-gNA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8563766479492188},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","photo_id":"fQDxInAvuAldw5lQjq38hw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fQDxInAvuAldw5lQjq38hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8455673456192017},{"business_id":"ECOUuwE5H1HHE8xBfNAjFg","photo_id":"pW69079a1MFKdSX7qsTMzg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pW69079a1MFKdSX7qsTMzg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8151763081550598}]},"notebook_case":null}
